<title>HONG KONG: Hanny interim net loss HK$164.96 mln.</title>
<headline>Hanny interim net loss HK$164.96 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  41.0 loss   vs 563.0 loss (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 132.24 loss vs 154.34 loss</p>
<p>    Net			   164.96 loss vs 294.60 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		    503.46	vs 828.99</p>
<p>    Company name		Hanny Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Hanny is a floppy disk maker.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$120.55 million on fixed assets being written down, HK$6.69 million on provision for slow-moving and obsolete stock and HK$5.0 million on provision for accounts receivable under litigation and on doubtful accounts.</p>
<p>Comparative loss per share has been adjusted for the effects of, inter alia, the consolidation of shares in February 1996 and the weighted average of 402.62 million shares vs 50.44 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
